### Internal KTRN balance bridge (svccode HP00001 / opcode HPOP001)
### For direct testing of the Middleware layer in isolation - the Client app and Admin portal
### never call this; only kopa.customer-self-care does.
@host = http://localhost:8082/kopa-middleware-ktrn

### 1. Check balance (ispCd omitted - falls back to ktrn.isp-cd default)
POST {{host}}/internal/v1/ktrn/balance
Content-Type: application/json

{ "msisdn": "0771000050" }

### 2. Check balance, explicit ispCd/chcode (matches the API doc's worked example)
POST {{host}}/internal/v1/ktrn/balance
Content-Type: application/json

{ "msisdn": "0771000050", "ispCd": "62", "chcode": "A" }

### 3. Invalid msisdn -> expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{host}}/internal/v1/ktrn/balance
Content-Type: application/json

{ "msisdn": "abc" }

### 4. Swagger UI / OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
